    "content" : "Let us now discuss in more detail the contexts of the last two references cited. In [MMM11], the authors addressed the problem in the space homogeneous case (that is with σ independent of x). They prouved that when F satisﬁes (1.6) and the collision frequency ν satisﬁes"
